0..74 Comment "/// This source converts two cases over cases of one stuck recursive call."
75..78 Comment "///"
79..156 Comment "/// It pins how the checker compares `outer(first(look(a, b)))` with the same"
157..215 Comment "/// cases, each written again by a twin of its definition."
216..219 Comment "///"
220..294 Comment "/// Each side\'s outer case eliminates a held endpoint whose computation is"
295..375 Comment "/// itself a case over the held call `look(a, b)`. The kernel reads each side as"
376..449 Comment "/// binds stacked over that call and makes them one by associativity. The"
450..529 Comment "/// checker records those steps, then compares the calls and the cases over one"
530..588 Comment "/// fresh variable, and the kernel replays the comparison."
589..592 Comment "///"
593..609 Comment "/// - see: #3086"
610..625 Comment "/// - see: #879"
